# The Matter service bundle: everything a service bundle may do (the SDV comm stack), plus the
# network as AOSP gives it to a network client (net_domain): UDP sockets bound to Matter's port
# and to mDNS's 5353 with the multicast groups joined, and the interface queries (netlink route,
# the interface ioctls). The other bundles reach the network only through SDV's agents.
# Why: bundles/matter/README.md.
typeattribute matter_service_bundle coredomain;
service_bundle_domain(matter_service_bundle)
net_domain(matter_service_bundle)
